{"title": "Hill Giant Finger", "pageid": 10612, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hill_Giant_Finger", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png/300px-Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/3/3a/Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hill Giant Finger image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png/300px-Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Hill_Giant_Finger_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hill Giant Finger</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to grind them into <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Hill_Giant_Fingernails\" title=\"Salts of Hill Giant Fingernails\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Extract_Grey_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Hill_Giant_Fingernails\" title=\"Salts of Hill Giant Fingernails\">Salts of Hill Giant Fingernails</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\">Elixir of Hill Giant Strength</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Thanks to the finger's vast size, each spot of fungus, mud, and flesh stuck beneath its fingernail is agonisingly clear.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\">Alchemical Ingredients</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" 